# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
# The theme (Sam, 2026-11-12: comparing palettes on the FM-1 without a flash each): Settings (GLO), any of K1-K4
# (THEME highlighted) steps through base's palettes at once, GARNET by default; the device keeps the choice through a reboot, the splash
# in it. A change while a song plays is kept only once all is silent, as the home is (a flash save stalls the audio).
listen
wait 1400
expect theme 12
tap GLO
wait 50
said SETTINGS. THEME GARNET
shot theme-settings.png
turn K1 -1
wait 50
said THEME OXBLOOD+
expect theme 11
turn K2 2
wait 50
said THEME GARNET+
expect theme 13
wait 100
expect theme_kept 1
reboot
expect splash 1
expect theme 13
wait 100
shot theme-splash.png
wait 1400
expect theme 13
tap PLAY
wait 3000
tap GLO
turn K1 1
wait 50
said THEME BLACK CHERRY
wait 2000
expect theme_kept 0
tap PLAY
wait 2000
expect theme_kept 1
reboot
wait 1400
expect theme 14
tap GLO
turn K1 -6
wait 50
said THEME PLUM
expect theme 8
turn K1 1
wait 50
said THEME PLUM+
expect theme 9
turn K2 1
wait 50
said THEME OXBLOOD
expect theme 10
turn K1 2
wait 50
said THEME GARNET
expect theme 12
turn K1 3
wait 50
said THEME GREEN
expect theme 0
